# Dark Samus: the dive out of the boost ball (fn_10_9424) and the dive's static wall hit
# (fn_10_11FA4 at 0x00012534). Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2, boss u04f7.
#
# Run it at the game's real speed (MP2_FRAME_LIMIT=1, no MP2_TICKS_PER_FRAME): the dive
# launches 167 to 200 ticks after the state change (the jump's XLAU event), and the placement
# has to land in the tick the dive is in flight, so the boss is put back into the wall every
# 10 ticks. The boost bit 0x01 (the dive record's 0xB20) is what skips the collision failsafe
# (0x00012018), which would otherwise put an actor placed in a wall back at its safe position
# before the static collision test runs. The wall is at (68.59, 466.5, 164.3): the boss ends
# the run there, against the wall, instead of at the player.
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f700 fsm u04f7 DiveFromBoost
@f860 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f870 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f880 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f890 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f900 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f910 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f920 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f930 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f940 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f950 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f960 place u04f7 68.59 466.5 164.3
@f980 objs darksamus
@f1000 objs darksamus
